AB  - Knowledge graphs provide a powerful paradigm for representing and querying complex, connected data. DOCK-G combines a LangGraph-based Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) chatbot with interactive visual analytics to address Mini-Challenge 3 of the VAST Challenge 2025. The system traverses communication nodes to surface relationships among entities—such as persons, vessels, and organizations—and helps identify participants who communicate using pseudonyms. The approach integrates text-to-SQL over an in-memory SQLite database, enabling fast, explainable retrieval and summarization. Reusable components are available in a public GitHub repository to facilitate future research at the intersection of knowledge graphs and RAG.
