AB  - Data is a collection of raw facts, figures, or details that, when processed, become meaningful information.” The special quality of the data is that it is considered a wealth of utmost significance in the technical world. The proposed AI-based multimodal system ensures this level of significance by maintaining data integrity and confidentiality for the same. This model is designed in such a way that it can take input from the user through text or can use a microphone to take commands from the end user. The system grips AI models for real-time document parsing, contextual question answering, and semantic analysis. The output of the device is that it uses advanced technology to answer user questions by finding important points from these documents in the formatted form of PDFs, URLs, and YouTube videos. It highlights the required information with page or slide numbers, making it easy to locate the information with accuracy and precision, resulting in a productive outcome by consuming a short time for the end-user.
