AB  - Through manual inquiry methods like phone calls, emails, and face-to-face visits, organizations face the problems of delayed responses, inconsistent information, limited staff members’ access and greater workload. To counter these limitations modern inquiry automation systems were developed and empowered by AI chatbots that are built with RetrievalAugmented Generation (RAG) [8]. The organization uses this method to collect all its knowledge which gets transformed into a vector database for permanent storage. The system uses this system design to access needed data with high speed. The system validates answers through trustworthy data sources. The system achieves better accuracy through vector search which identifies contextually relevant data. The knowledge which has been collected after a user makes a request helps a small language model to produce highly accurate and steady responses. The systems operate continuously to handle multiple users while delivering dependable and current information. The system provides an AI-assisted inquiry automation solution which achieves both maximum scalability and complete future readiness.
